# P12: the Patch step FX on Tracker+ (the plus panel: Pattern key, the list moves by tap Down as on the Mini).
# Pattern, Rec on, hold FX2 (Fx) for the FX list, Down to "Patch" (list position 46 on Tracker+ and Mini, FEATURE_SYNTH_PATCHFX), release:
# the step under the cursor gets the Patch FX (title bar "O - Patch"). Ends on the state read: expect peek lastUsedFx reads the list position of the Patch FX
title: Patch FX on Tracker+ (P12)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

tap Pattern
wait 1000ms
tap Rec
wait 600ms
press Fx
wait 1200ms
tap Down x46
wait 800ms
shot patchfx-list
release Fx
wait 800ms
expect text "O - Patch"
tap Rec
wait 600ms
shot patchfx-step
expect peek lastUsedFx 46
